{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L1dlcmV3b2xmJTIwJTI4MjAxOCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Werewolf","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/egSBfZCPeZvaSx4IKXKRqhH8DIg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/264l5unkfbaHeUEv0J4HbaUUyxJ.jpg","description":"Summer of 1945. A temporary orphanage is established in an abandoned palace surrounded by forests for the eight children liberated from the Gross-Rosen camp. Hanka, also a former inmate, becomes their guardian. After the atrocities of the camp, the protagonists slowly begin to regain what is left of their childhood but the horror returns quickly. Camp Alsatians roam the forests around. Released by the SS earlier on, they have gone feral and are starving. Looking for food they besiege the palace. The children are terrified and their camp survival instinct is triggered.","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Horror","War","History","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.3","runtime":"88 min","cast":["Nicolas Przygoda","Kamil Polnisiak","Sonia Mietielica","Werner Daehn","Danuta Stenka","Jakub Syska","Helena Mazur","Krzysztof Durski"],"director":["Adrian Panek"],"released":"2019-03-29T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Liberation was just the beginning...","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Nicolas Przygoda","character":"Janek"},{"name":"Kamil Polnisiak","character":"Władek"},{"name":"Sonia Mietielica","character":"Hanka","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/m8yUMwFO4WlCbu2S9L3KZPGNsBO.jpg"},{"name":"Werner Daehn","character":"SS Man","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7AVQ2pesALZjo5J0KsYADzoms9Z.jpg"},{"name":"Danuta Stenka","character":"Jadwiga","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vtceTxqqNMbxwXGuVT2TxZCOVD7.jpg"},{"name":"Jakub Syska","character":"Siwi"},{"name":"Helena Mazur","character":"Ruda"},{"name":"Krzysztof Durski","character":"Czarny"},{"name":"Maksymilian Balcerowski","character":"Chudy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5QChsZmvXhFcyDPxWTsTWQM9GsV.j